        "text": "Justice Kennedy asked whether a state conviction that would have been punishable under the Federal law meets the definition of a drug\u2011trafficking crime."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Stevens",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "e3765dd5a716713bc161ee2666a85786ef7809d8ce4dbc68a524e2779d3fd43c",
