              "start": 40
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Stevens, justice Stevens questioned whether a state felony can ever be punishable under a federal statute."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice Roberts",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "e3765dd5a716713bc161ee2666a85786ef7809d8ce4dbc68a524e2779d3fd43c",
